TellyTile

TellyTile's original contributions are distributed under the MIT License in
LICENSE. Bundled third-party components retain their own licenses and notices.

The firmware and audio companion include portable CodeCraft AI Hardware
exports. Their Apache-2.0 license and notices are retained in the respective
LICENSE and NOTICE files. TellyTile modifies the Indicator display integration,
RGB scanout settings, and application behavior, and adapts the reSpeaker audio
example for use as a network audio companion.

The bundled protocol sources, JSON parser and font retain their respective
MIT or SIL OFL notices. UPSTREAM.md lists their sources. The binary releases
include components from those source trees and ESP-IDF. The DX source archive
includes the corresponding notices.

The project cover is an illustration based on the form of Seeed Studio's
SenseCAP Indicator. The screen shows an illustrated city scene.
